:heroine_05", "tag": "sisy23_sem_ask", "text": "我要練一次 seminar 的報告。需要一個不是法研所的人聽。"}, {"day": 428, "date": "2026-11-18", "h": 22, "from": "heroine_05", "th": "p:heroine_05", "tag": "sisy23_sem_ask_miss", "text": "講完了。牆沒有意見。"}, {"day": 435, "date": "2026-11-25", "h": 22.12, "from": "heroine_02", "th": "p:heroine_02", "tag": "r3_zr_fee2", "text": "出版社回信了。我自己寫的信，他們付了。"}, {"day": 446, "date": "2026-12-06", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_03", "th": "p:heroine_03", "tag": "need_446", "text": "秀琴姨問你週末來不來吃飯。"}, {"day": 458, "date": "2026-12-18", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_01", "th": "p:heroine_01", "tag": "aa532_an_plan_Y2S1", "text": "我報了東京的冬季短期課。兩週。"}, {"day": 464, "date": "2026-12-24", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_05", "th": "g:family_law", "tag": "sis539_grp_1", "text": "📷（研究室窗外，總圖的燈）"}, {"day": 464, "date": "2026-12-24", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_05", "th": "g:family_law", "tag": "sis539_grp_1", "text": "聖誕快樂。"}]}, "Y2S2": {"range": ["2027-02-22", "2027-06-13"], "total": 35, "count": {"heroine_01": 12, "heroine_02": 6, "heroine_03": 10, "heroine_04": 3, "heroine_05": 4}, "gaps14": [{"days": 35, "from": "2027-04-01", "to": "2027-05-05"}, {"days": 17, "from": "2027-05-18", "to": "2027-06-03"}], "first": {"heroine_02": "2027-02-22", "heroine_05": "2027-02-28", "heroine_01": "2027-03-11", "heroine_03": "2027-03-23", "heroine_04": "2027-05-16"}, "msgs": [{"day": 524, "date": "2027-02-22", "h": 7.7, "from": "heroine_02", "th": "g:ge_econ", "tag": "ge_grp1", "text": "我負責剪片。不要叫我上台。"}, {"day": 524, "date": "2027-02-22", "h": 22.12, "from": "heroine_02", "th": "p:heroine_02", "tag": "zr_dm1", "text": "我是經原那組的芷若。"}, {"day": 524, "date": "2027-02-22", "h": 22.13, "from": "heroine_02", "th": "p:heroine_02", "tag": "zr_dm1", "text": "也是兩點半那個店員。"}, {"day": 524, "date": "2027-02-22", "h": 22.14, "from": "heroine_02", "th": "p:heroine_02", "tag": "zr_dm1", "text": "你剛剛在群組回得很快。我以為法律系的人都很慢。"}, {"day": 530, "date": "2027-02-28", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_05", "th": "p:heroine_05", "tag": "need_530", "text": "法圖那本行政救濟的書被借走了。你們班上有人有嗎？"}, {"day": 539, "date": "2027-03-09", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_05", "th": "g:family_law", "tag": "fam_dinner_y2s2_invite", "text": "好。"}, {"day": 541, "date": "2027-03-11", "h": 12.67, "from": "heroine_01", "th": "g:noodle_team", "tag": "y2_azalea", "text": "📷（杜鵑花。和去年同一個位置。）"}, {"day": 545, "date": "2027-03-15", "h": 9.33, "from": "heroine_01", "th": "g:noodle_team", "tag": "y2_expo_an", "text": "我會去。坐第一排。"}, {"day": 548, "date": "2027-03-18", "h": 20, "from": "heroine_01", "th": "g:noodle_team", "tag": "y2_expo_missed", "text": "📷（說明會的簡報）"}, {"day": 548, "date": "2027-03-18", "h": 20.01, "from": "heroine_01", "th": "g:noodle_team", "tag": "y2_expo_missed", "text": "重點在第七頁。"}, {"day": 549, "date": "2027-03-19", "h": 21.33, "from": "heroine_01", "th": "p:heroine_01", "tag": "aa720_an_later_dm", "text": "……你應該已經聽 Alison 說了。"}, {"day": 550, "date": "2027-03-20", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_05", "th": "g:family_law", "tag": "heard_h506_kevin", "text": "你自己挑的。"}, {"day": 552, "date": "2027-03-22", "h": 21.67, "from": "heroine_01", "th": "p:heroine_01", "tag": "dp_a118_y2s2_an_expo_0_0", "text": "說明會的資料四十頁，我讀完了。有三頁是同一頁印兩次。"}, {"day": 553, "date": "2027-03-23", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_03", "th": "g:noodle_team", "tag": "y2_spring_plan", "text": "我問蘇姨能不能排休"}, {"day": 559, "date": "2027-03-29", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_03", "th": "g:noodle_team", "tag": "bb_b7_poster", "text": "📷（海報：「老房子、租屋與城市」）"}, {"day": 560, "date": "2027-03-30", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_03", "th": "g:noodle_team", "tag": "y2s2_spring_grp", "text": "第一站是市場。"}, {"day": 560, "date": "2027-03-30", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_03", "th": "g:noodle_team", "tag": "y2s2_spring_grp", "text": "……田野課的。我想自己去看一次。"}, {"day": 561, "date": "2027-03-31", "h": 21.67, "from": "heroine_01", "th": "p:heroine_01", "tag": "dp_a118_y2s2_an_question_0_0", "text": "我今天在課堂上問了一個問題。老師說『好問題』。我只想要答案。"}, {"day": 597, "date": "2027-05-06", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_05", "th": "g:family_law", "tag": "sisb13_curry_ask", "text": "白飯我煮了。你帶水果。"}, {"day": 598, "date": "2027-05-07", "h": 22.12, "from": "heroine_02", "th": "p:heroine_02", "tag": "r3_zr_swan_miss", "text": "📷（店裡的黑板：本月冠軍：老闆。本月最有想法：在想事情的天鵝。）"}, {"day": 598, "date": "2027-05-07", "h": 22.13, "from": "heroine_02", "th": "p:heroine_02", "tag": "r3_zr_swan_miss", "text": "老闆寫的。"}, {"day": 607, "date": "2027-05-16", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_04", "th": "p:heroine_04", "tag": "need_607", "text": "欸跟你說"}, {"day": 607, "date": "2027-05-16", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_04", "th": "p:heroine_04", "tag": "need_607", "text": "我爸下週要來台北"}, {"day": 607, "date": "2027-05-16", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_04", "th": "p:heroine_04", "tag": "need_607", "text": "他說要來看我"}, {"day": 608, "date": "2027-05-17", "h": 21.33, "from": "heroine_03", "th": "p:heroine_03", "tag": "dp_a118_y2s2_yt_ta_form_0_0", "text": "📷（社會系助教的申請表）"}, {"day": 608, "date": "2027-05-17", "h": 21.35, "from": "heroine_03", "th": "p:heroine_03", "tag": "dp_a118_y2s2_yt_ta_form_0_1", "text": "填好了。還沒交。"}, {"day": 626, "date": "2027-06-04", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_01", "th": "p:heroine_01", "tag": "aa532_an_plan_Y2S2", "text": "七月考日檢。八月去京都上語言課。"}, {"day": 626, "date": "2027-06-04", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_01", "th": "g:noodle_team", "tag": "y2r2_an13", "text": "之前在幫家教學生的家裡看一份駁回的公文。"}, {"day": 626, "date": "2027-06-04", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_01", "th": "g:noodle_team", "tag": "y2r2_an13", "text": "那個家的訴願，原本的決定被撤銷了，要重新審。"}, {"day": 626, "date": "2027-06-04", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_01", "th": "g:noodle_team", "tag": "y2r2_an13", "text": "不是全贏。可是有人要重新看他們的資料了。"}, {"day": 626, "date": "2027-06-04", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_01", "th": "g:noodle_team", "tag": "y2r2_an13", "text": "📷（一張手寫的卡片，字看不清楚，只看得到最後一行：老師，謝謝妳畫的那張圖。）"}, {"day": 634, "date": "2027-06-12", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_03", "th": "p:heroine_03", "tag": "y2_yt_aunt_msg", "text": "上次我陪秀琴姨去法服。"}, {"day": 634, "date": "2027-06-12", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_03", "th": "p:heroine_03", "tag": "y2_yt_aunt_msg", "text": "裡面的人說，租約到期以前，新屋主不能叫她搬。"}, {"day": 634, "date": "2027-06-12", "h": 21, "from": "heroine_03", "th": "p:heroine_03", "tag": "y2_yt_aunt_msg", "text": "她出來的時候在笑。"}, {"day": 635, "date": "2027-06-13", "h": 21.33, "from": "heroine_03", "th": "p:heroine_03", "tag": "dp_a118_y2s2_yt_garlic_0_0", "text": "今天茶屋很安靜。我在洗杯子。"}]}}